<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>CloudHost - 인프라 상세 및 관리</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/pages/server-detail.css}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/common/layout.css}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/common/navbar.css}">

<style>
.deploy-section {
    margin-top: 24px;
}

.deploy-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #dbe3ef;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
}

.deploy-card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #0f3c8f;
}

.deploy-desc,
.deploy-help {
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 8px 0 16px;
}

.deploy-form {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.deploy-form input[type="file"] {
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px;
    background: #f8fafc;
}

.deploy-form button {
    border: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 11px 18px;
    background: #1565d8;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.deploy-success {
    background: #e8f7ee;
    color: #16783a;
    border: 1px solid #bce8cb;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.deploy-error {
    background: #fff1f2;
    color: #be123c;
    border: 1px solid #fecdd3;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar">
    <a href="/dashboard" class="logo">☁️ Cloud<span>Host</span></a>
    <div class="user-info">
        <strong><span th:text="${username != null ? username : '사용자'}">사용자</span></strong>님 로그인 중
        <a href="/logout" class="logout-btn">로그아웃</a>
    </div>
</nav>

<div class="container">
    <a href="/servers/my" class="back-link">← 목록으로 돌아가기</a>

    <div class="header-box">
        <h1>패키지 상세 자원 스펙 관리</h1>
        <span style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;"
              th:text="${order.createdAt != null ? '신청일시: ' + #temporals.format(order.createdAt, 'yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') : '신청일시 정보 없음'}">
            신청일시
        </span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-two">
        <div class="sub-box web">
            <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:25px;">
                <h2 class="section-title" style="color:#1565c0; margin:0;">🖥️ 웹 서버 명세</h2>
                <a th:if="${webInfo != null and webInfo['web_url'] != null}"
                   th:href="${webInfo['web_url']}"
                   target="_blank"
                   style="background:#1565c0; color:white; padding:7px 14px; border-radius:4px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none;">
                    웹 접속
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">가상 컴퓨터 인스턴스 명칭</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${order.webServerName}">web-name</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">웹 호스트 식별 상세 설명</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${order.webDesc != null ? order.webDesc : '설명 없음'}">설명 없음</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">웹 서버 내부 IP</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${webServer != null ? webServer['internal_ip'] : '할당 대기 중'}">192.168.10.x</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">웹 외부 접속 URL</span>
                <span class="val">
                    <a th:if="${webInfo != null and webInfo['web_url'] != null}"
                       th:href="${webInfo['web_url']}"
                       th:text="${webInfo['web_url']}"
                       target="_blank">/site/34/</a>
                    <span th:if="${webInfo == null or webInfo['web_url'] == null}">연결 대기 중</span>
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">할당된 가상 CPU 코어</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${order.webCpu} + ' Cores'">2 Cores</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">할당 메모리 용량</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${order.webRam} + ' GB'">4 GB</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">웹 스토리지 디스크</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${order.webStorage} + ' GB'">50 GB</span>
            </div>

            <hr style="margin:18px 0; border:0; border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">FTP Host</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${webInfo != null ? webInfo['ftp_host'] : '발급 대기 중'}">192.168.10.x</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">FTP Port</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${webInfo != null ? webInfo['ftp_port'] : '21'}">21</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">FTP 계정</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${webInfo != null ? webInfo['ftp_username'] : '발급 대기 중'}">webftp</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">FTP 비밀번호</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${webInfo != null ? webInfo['ftp_password'] : '발급 대기 중'}">password</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">FTP 업로드 경로</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${webInfo != null ? webInfo['ftp_path'] : '/var/www/html'}">/var/www/html</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-box db">
            <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:25px;">
                <h2 class="section-title" style="color:#2e7d32; margin:0;">🗄️ 데이터베이스 명세</h2>
                <a th:if="${dbInfo != null and dbInfo['db_console_url'] != null}"
                   th:href="${dbInfo['db_console_url']}"
                   target="_blank"
                   style="background:#2e7d32; color:white; padding:7px 14px; border-radius:4px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none;">
                    콘솔 열기
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">데이터베이스 인스턴스 명칭</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${order.dbServerName}">db-name</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">DB 서버 내부 IP</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${dbServer != null ? dbServer['internal_ip'] : '연결 대기 중'}">192.168.10.x</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">DB Host</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${dbInfo != null ? dbInfo['db_host'] : '연결 대기 중'}">192.168.10.x</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">DB Port</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${dbInfo != null ? dbInfo['db_port'] : '3306'}">3306</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">DB 콘솔 URL</span>
                <span class="val">
                    <a th:if="${dbInfo != null and dbInfo['db_console_url'] != null}"
                       th:href="${dbInfo['db_console_url']}"
                       th:text="${dbInfo['db_console_url']}"
                       target="_blank">/db-console/35/</a>
                    <span th:if="${dbInfo == null or dbInfo['db_console_url'] == null}">연결 대기 중</span>
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">Adminer 로그인 서버</span>
                <span class="val">localhost</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">기본 생성 스키마 물리명</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${dbInfo != null ? dbInfo['db_name'] : order.dbName}">testdb01</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">DB 사용자 계정</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${dbInfo != null ? dbInfo['db_username'] : order.dbUsername}">test</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">DB 비밀번호</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${dbInfo != null ? dbInfo['db_password'] : order.dbPassword}">test1234</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">할당된 가상 CPU 코어</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${order.dbCpu} + ' Cores'">2 Cores</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">할당 메모리 용량</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${order.dbRam} + ' GB'">4 GB</span>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="label">DB 볼륨 스토리지 용량</span>
                <span class="val" th:text="${order.dbStorage} + ' GB'">100 GB</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-card">
        <h2 class="section-title">⚙️ 가상 인프라 자원 스펙 추가 확장 (Scale-Up)</h2>
        <form id="upgradeForm" th:action="@{/servers/upgrade}" method="POST">
            <input type="hidden" name="packageId" th:value="${order.requestId}">
            <input type="hidden" id="payAmountInput" name="payAmount" value="0">

            <div class="grid-two" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
                <div>
                    <h3 style="font-size:14px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:10px; color:#1565c0;">Web 서버 확장 옵션</h3>
                    <div class="form-group-spec">
                        <label>CPU 변경</label>
                        <select name="webCpu" class="select-ctrl" id="wCpu" onchange="calcDiffPrice()">
                            <option value="2" data-cost="0" th:selected="${order.webCpu == 2}">vCPU 2 Cores (기본)</option>
                            <option value="4" data-cost="10000" th:selected="${order.webCpu == 4}">vCPU 4 Cores (+10,000원)</option>
                            <option value="8" data-cost="25000" th:selected="${order.webCpu == 8}">vCPU 8 Cores (+25,000원)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openPaymentModal()">🛒 스펙 인프라 변경 및 추가 차액 결제</button>
        </form>
    </div>

    <div class="info-card" style="border: 1px solid #fca5a5;">
        <h2 class="section-title" style="color: #dc2626;">🚨 Danger Zone (위험 구역)</h2>
        <div class="danger-zone">
            <form th:action="@{/servers/delete}" method="POST" onsubmit="return confirm('정말 삭제하시겠습니까?');">
                <input type="hidden" name="packageId" th:value="${order.requestId}">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger">서버 영구 삭제</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


        <section class="deploy-section">
            <div class="deploy-card">
                <h2>📦 웹 파일 ZIP 배포</h2>

                <p class="deploy-desc">
                    ZIP 파일을 업로드하면 내부에서 index.html을 자동으로 찾아 웹 서버에 배포합니다.
                </p>

                <div th:if="${successMessage}" class="deploy-success" th:text="${successMessage}"></div>
                <div th:if="${errorMessage}" class="deploy-error" th:text="${errorMessage}"></div>

                <form th:action="@{/servers/detail/{requestId}/deploy(requestId=${order['request_id']})}"
                      method="post"
                      enctype="multipart/form-data"
                      class="deploy-form">
                    <input type="file" name="zipFile" accept=".zip" required>
                    <button type="submit">ZIP 업로드 및 배포</button>
                </form>

                <p class="deploy-help">
                    업로드 후 웹 접속 URL에서 결과를 확인하세요.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

</body>
</html>
